   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RPP IIB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RPP IIB is a prolongation of an earlier Sida financed project, RPP II, which aims to support the development of the regional management institutes in Kaluga, Penza and Saratov in order to make them sustainable in giving &quot;Develop Your Business&quot; training without external subsidies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RPP IIB skall fungera som en f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning av en insats som Sida st&#xF6;dde tidigare (RPP II), vilket inneb&#xE4;r att st&#xF6;dja en utveckling av de regionala managementinstituten i Kaluga, Penza och Saratov s&#xE5; att dessa sj&#xE4;lva skall kunna driva &quot;Develop Your Business&quot; program utan st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
